   ("the-lineage", "THE LINEAGE", "#2fd4e6", "learning machines - perceptron to hybrid, one best idea each", "The Lineage - perceptron to hybrid, one best idea each. A purple-paper side-sheet of the learning-machines arc. David Lee Wise own artifact. &middot; homed in the ai realm beside its hub [[perceptron-in-silicon]]."),
   ("attention-hourglass", "THE ATTENTION HOURGLASS", "#2fd4e6", "two compilers, one prediction", "The Attention Hourglass - two compilers, one prediction. On the shape of attention and transformer inference. David Lee Wise own authored artifact."), ("attention-mesh", "THE ATTENTION MESH · attention topology", "#ff5a00", "AI · David Lee Wise / ROOT0 · causal attention as a complete weighted directed graph · chord diagram + 3D inverse helix · amber tier · live", "THE ATTENTION MESH · David Lee Wise / ROOT0. Causal attention drawn as its HONEST TOPOLOGY — a complete weighted directed graph. Not two strands (a double helix has exclusive one-to-one rungs), not a funnel (a funnel is a pipe): attention is ONE SENTENCE CROSSED WITH ITSELF, the same tokens on both axes, many-to-one with graded weights. Two channels: a 2D CHORD DIAGRAM (the graph flattened onto a ring, chords bowed through the interior · orange sink edges to token 0, green recency edges, grey the rest; isolate one query or see the full mesh) and a 3D INVERSE HELIX (the helix turned inside-out: a QUERY ring on top, a KEY ring below · the same sentence in its two roles, looker and looked-at · each weight a strand bowing through the central axis; every query's strongest strand dives to the same SINK point, a convergent many-to-one gather). ⚑ The topology-COMPANION to [[attention-hourglass|THE ATTENTION HOURGLASS]]: the hourglass shows attention as FLOW (Q/K pinching to one prediction); the mesh shows it as STRUCTURE · the whole weighted graph, the funnel argued past. Kin to [[ttu1|TTU1 · Transformer Tech]]. ⚑ AMBER TIER: the topology is EXACT (this is genuinely how a causal attention layer connects · every token can attend every earlier token, each edge a continuous weight), but the weights are MODELED to reproduce documented structure (attention SINKS on the first token, RECENCY bias, a heavy TAIL), not extracted from a trained network · stated plainly on the page. Verify-then-build: every attention row is a valid causal distribution (sums to 1, no attending the future), the sink dominant (every query's top-1 is token 0). Offline single file, zero runtime network, system fonts, fail-loud. ROOT0."), ("blackboard-lineage", "THE BLACKBOARD LINEAGE · 1959→2026", "#e0662e", "AI · David Lee Wise / ROOT0 · the shared-workspace architecture, traced across every generation since 1959 · seven stations, soft-GL 3D + era diagrams · honesty-tiered · live", "THE BLACKBOARD LINEAGE · David Lee Wise / ROOT0. A HERITAGE INSTRUMENT: one architecture — many private specialists, one small shared board they broadcast to — reinvented every generation since 1959, and found last summer growing untended inside a language model. SEVEN STATIONS: Selfridge's PANDEMONIUM (1959, the din of feature-demons) · HEARSAY-II (1975, the word 'blackboard' enters computing as a literal shared data structure) · Baars' GLOBAL WORKSPACE (1988, the spotlight on a stage of specialists in the dark) · Dehaene & Changeux's GLOBAL NEURONAL WORKSPACE (1998, ignition: sub-threshold sparks die, a supra-threshold one fires all-or-none and becomes reportable) · the LOGIT & TUNED LENSES (2020/2023, the residual stream as a shared additive bus, features in superposition) · and the 2026 JACOBIAN-LENS finding that measures the transport and reveals J-space, a small subspace the model can report, modulate, and use · then the FRACTAL recurrence (heads share the residual stream, positions the context window, agents a transcript, collaborators a repository). A soft-GL 3D board (specialists compete, post, broadcast) + era diagrams, offline, fail-loud. ⚑ HONESTY-TIERED and it is the point: LIT (verified/mine — the soft-GL projection math checks 16/16 in node), BRI (bridged/inferred — the architecture RHYME is an interpretive frame, not a proof), SPEC (attested, not witnessed — the 2026 workspace-in-a-model finding: lens math + data pipeline verified by hand, but the report/modulate/use triad lives on hardware this instrument has not run). The emergence claim is HEDGED, not asserted. The interpretability-geometry sibling of [[attention-hourglass|THE ATTENTION HOURGLASS]] (the shape of attention) and [[attention-mesh|THE ATTENTION MESH]] (attention topology); kin to [[ttu1|TTU1 · Transformer Tech]]. The 200-year-old-idea curse on schedule: a matrix of partial derivatives from 1841 to catch a 1959 architecture a 2026 model rebuilt on its own. Blackboards all the way down. ROOT0."), ("the-flooding", "THE FLOODING · attention as diffusion", "#56C8F0", "AI · David Lee Wise / ROOT0 · an attention matrix is a random-walk transition matrix, so diffusion is exactly A^t · pour water at a token, watch it flood real BERT attention · self-testable · live", "THE FLOODING · David Lee Wise / ROOT0. Attention rows sum to 1, so an attention matrix IS a random-walk transition matrix and diffusion is just the matrix raised to powers, A^t · no modeling. Pour water at one token and watch it flow along REAL BERT attention: it POOLS FAST inside a cluster (same sees same), TRICKLES SLOW through the necks between them; by t~16 it reaches its stationary distribution. Each token-basin is classified by three MEASURED diffusion properties · movement (escape rate 1-Aii), depth (stationary level pi_i), scale (tributary count) · into six water bodies (pond/pool/swamp static, creek/lake/ocean dynamic). A 2D flooding + a 3D diffusion-map (tokens by diffusion distance, flooded by water level), offline, soft-GL, fail-loud. ⚑ GREEN SUBSTRATE and AMBER STORY, both true at once: GREEN = real attention, EXACT diffusion (A^t, mass conserved), exact stationary distribution (a true fixed point pi.A=pi), exact spectral embedding (all verified in node). AMBER = in HEAD 0 the diffusion properties separate function words (the/over/near, flow 0.96) from content words (fox/dog/river, deep pools) sharply, and it PASSES A SHUFFLE TEST (scramble the matrix and the separation collapses to ~0 · real structure, not a metric artifact) · but it is HEAD-SPECIFIC (head 1 much weaker) and this is ONE sentence, so a real shuffle-validated correlation in this head, NOT a universal law; and the six water-body names are an imposed vocabulary over exact measurements. The v2 HONESTLY downgraded v1's 'nobody labeled these, the flow did' to this head-specific claim. The DIFFUSION-FLOW member of the interpretability-geometry cluster: how attention looks as a different geometric object each time · [[attention-hourglass|THE ATTENTION HOURGLASS]] (flow to a prediction), [[attention-mesh|THE ATTENTION MESH]] (topology), [[blackboard-lineage|THE BLACKBOARD LINEAGE]] (the shared workspace), and THE FLOODING (diffusion). Kin to [[ttu1|TTU1 · Transformer Tech]]. ROOT0."),
