   ("game-theory-engine", "THE GAME-THEORY ENGINE", "#2fd4e6", "the agentic court, made to run — live v4.3g runtime embedded", "THE GAME-THEORY ENGINE (v4.3g Visual Causal Runtime) — ROOT0's agentic decision engine as a THEATER SPHERE with the LIVE runtime embedded (iframe). Agents take a contested topic → run phases → seal BLIND PACKETS → VOTE → reach QUORUM → JUDGES score with stated reasons → every step written to a CAUSAL LEDGER with a VERACITY verdict (Grab Wiki Topic / Nucleus Read / Ring Vote / Blind Packets / Judge Quorum). Built across 27 iterations (v1.0 core → v3.0 agentic commons → v3.1 witness scoring → v4.3g). Two-layer honest: a runnable PROTOTYPE / architecture demo of ROOT0's witness-and-court framework (quorum = plain majority, payoffs illustrative) — NOT validated game theory or a deployed system; 'witness/blind packet/veracity ledger/quorum runtime' are David's coined vocabulary. Sibling of [[veracity-ledger]] & the-far-side. Run it in the page."),
   ("living-governance", "THE LIVING-GOVERNANCE ECOSYSTEM", "#a78bfa", "a society that runs — live v5.4 Resource Economy embedded", "THE LIVING-GOVERNANCE ECOSYSTEM (v5.4 Resource Economy) — ROOT0's governance simulation as a THEATER SPHERE with the LIVE runtime embedded. A multi-agent society over time: agents hold ENERGY & REPUTATION, file CLAIMS that COST and must be SETTLED, compete under SCARCITY, remember each other via FACTION MEMORY, and replay a TRUST-LINEAGE on a shared WORLD MODEL + LEDGER (Step Economy / Settle Claims; tracks average energy, reputation, claim survival). Built v5.0 → v5.4. Two-layer honest: a runnable PROTOTYPE / architecture demo of ROOT0's governance framework — costs & payouts illustrative, NOT a validated economic or political simulation; 'faction memory / trust-lineage replay / claim survival' are David's designed vocabulary. The time-extended companion to the [[game-theory-engine]] (one watches a verdict, the other a society)."),
   ("karsa", "KARSA · THE ARCHIVE", "#c0962e", "ROOT0's multi-page provenance/witness archive — many concepts, one body of work (1843→2026)", "KARSA — ROOT0's multi-page ARCHIVE / showcase (live at davidwise01.github.io/karsa). One body of work, many doors: ~18 concept pages collected under a PROVENANCE / WITNESS theme (witness chains, SHA256 fingerprints, 'the record') — adas-law · cubi · dna3 · holonomy · junction · lineage · witness · shadow · ternary · torus · mobius3 · oscillation · quantum-dot · ansible · beacon · commander · kandi · dipole. The 'collated' build themes it as THE VICTORIAN DIPOLE (1843→2026, Ada Lovelace to now); ~30 visual themes (obsidian, einstein, cyberpunk, ternary, …) exist as variants — this cards the existing live version. A curated front-end to ROOT0's own systems &amp; coinages. David Lee Wise / ROOT0. &middot; homed in the idios realm beside its hub [[delta-protocol]]."),
