   ("fusion-n0-n255", "FUSION_N0_N255 · reproducible Merkle commitment", "#4a7fc0", "idios — verify ROOT0 bit-for-bit", "A reproducible Merkle commitment over the 256-node STOICHEION axiom space; running python verify.py reproduces the ROOT0 root hash bit-for-bit. Explicitly framed as real code, not emergent, under CC-BY-ND-4.0. David Lee Wise (ROOT0). &middot; homed in the idios realm beside its hub [[delta-protocol]]."),
   ("genten", "原点 · Genten — the origin datum", "#cc785c", "idios — the point everything is measured from", "A meditation on the datum: 原点 / Genten is the point everything is measured from and nothing is measured at, the reference that has no value of its own. Rendered in the warm-ink AVAN style. David Lee Wise (ROOT0). &middot; homed in the idios realm beside its hub [[delta-protocol]]."),
