   ("higgs-suite", "HIGGS SUITE · particle-physics simulators", "#4a86c0", "scientific — Standard Model, gravity, dark matter", "A suite of pure Canvas 2D particle-physics simulators spanning the Standard Model, quantum gravity, and dark matter, with 14 particle types, six keyboard controls, and a spacetime-warp view, all with zero dependencies. Interactive visualizations rather than research-grade solvers. David Lee Wise (ROOT0). &middot; homed in the scientific realm beside its hub [[atomic-structure]]."),
   ("holograms", "HOLOGRAM SUITE · interference physics", "#5aa8c0", "scientific — H = |R+O|² interference", "An interference-physics sandbox: draw objects, encode color depth, and compute holograms via H = |R+O|², including a STOICHEION 256-axiom hologram. Demonstrates the fractal reconstruction property, where cutting any piece still reconstructs the whole. David Lee Wise (ROOT0). &middot; homed in the scientific realm beside its hub [[atomic-structure]]."),
