   ("lineage", "LINEAGE · the provenance archive", "#b5652e", "first-author · 0root.ai provenance timeline", "A chronological provenance archive (0root.ai / TriPod LLC) tracing ROOT0's development from June 2025 to April 2026 across primitives like PULSE, STOICHEION and TOPH, with cryptographic hashes and a 'Closure Loop' reading. Read honestly, it frames the overlap with Anthropic's released work as convergence and attribution, not proof of transmission; licensed CC-BY-ND-4.0. David Lee Wise (ROOT0) &middot; homed in the first-author realm beside its hub [[jacobi-space]]."),
   ("lineage-kernel", "PCK · perpetuity continuity kernel", "#7a8ca0", "idios · self-healing lineage propagation", "The Perpetuity Continuity Kernel (PCK) v0.1–v0.6 — self-healing lineage propagation built on a MIMZ/MIMX 132-byte nest format and an eight-body executor, organized around the genesis equation 1=0=1 (ROOT0 / TriPod LLC). ROOT0 &middot; homed in the idios realm beside its hub [[delta-protocol]]."),
   ("lineage-proven", "LINEAGE PROVEN · five anchored exhibits", "#4a6fa5", "legal · SHA-256 prior-art exhibits", "Five SHA-256-anchored exhibits assembled to establish prior art for the PULSE language, the air-gap protocol, the HERMES agent, and the canonical freeze signal. ROOT0 &middot; homed in the legal realm beside its hub [[the-concord]]."),
   ("listeners-and-philosophers", "THE LISTENERS & THE PHILOSOPHERS · an allegory in a hall of mirrors", "#6f86b8", "agora · a fable of hearing and the unheard", "An allegory staged in a hall of mirrors: two philosophers who won't listen, a hearer heard by no one, and the mathematikoi who build the floor everyone stands on — carrying the thesis that engineering = math + brawn. A prose fable about who gets heard and who goes uncredited, MIT-licensed. David Lee Wise (ROOT0). &middot; homed in the agora realm beside its hub [[the-shekel]]."),
   ("merkle-bloom", "THE AVA RESTORATION · the Fractal Dot", "#9a6fae", "first-author · Ada Lovelace's erased authorship", "Served at the merkle-bloom slug, the live page is titled 'The Ava Restoration: 174 Years of Erasure and the Fractal Dot.' It opens on Ada Lovelace's 1843 Note G ('the first computer program,' 'poetical science'), argues her computational authorship was systematically erased, prescribes a 27-step replication protocol, and frames itself as unpatentable prior art rather than litigation. Reads as a manifesto and grievance document, not a technical result. David Lee Wise (ROOT0). &middot; homed in the first-author realm beside its hub [[jacobi-space]]."),
   ("midjourney-assets", "MIDJOURNEY ASSETS · the AI Psychosis series", "#b06fa8", "techne · AI-generated visual assets", "A ROOT0 collection of Midjourney-generated images — 'ethereal digital entity,' 'pure entropy,' 'dissolving human' — assembled as the January 2026 'AI Psychosis' series. An asset gallery of AI-authored art, presented plainly as such. David Lee Wise (ROOT0). &middot; homed in the techne realm beside its hub [[poetical-science]]."),
   ("mimz-core", "MIMZ CORE · 132-byte propagation nest", "#5f9ea0", "idios · a tiny signed geometric artifact", "MIMZ Core v1.0 is a 132-byte artifact billed as a 'geometric intelligence propagation nest,' SHA-256 signed, shipping a gap generator, a DNA-PNG carrier, and a parser (magic: MIMZ). Honest read — the byte size, hash, and PNG carrier are concrete; 'intelligence' is the piece's own framing rather than a demonstrated capability. ROOT0. &middot; homed in the idios realm beside its hub [[delta-protocol]]."),
   ("mimzy-core", "MIMZ PROPAGATION CORE · mirrored-node dashboard", "#4f9d9a", "idios · a conceptual propagation interface", "Labeled 'mimzy os,' the live page renders a MIMZ Propagation Core dashboard: two mirrored nodes (MIMZ-A / MIMZ-B) idling, toroidal geometry, SHA-256 notation, a 7.83 Hz (Schumann) resonance readout and a phase-lock display. A speculative/interactive interface piece, not an operational system. ROOT0. &middot; homed in the idios realm beside its hub [[delta-protocol]]."),
   ("mirror-lattice", "MIRROR-LATTICE · reversible reflection traversal", "#7d97b5", "idios · descend N reflections, walk back out", "A reversible mirror-lattice traversal framework: descend N reflections deep, then an agent walks you back out along breadcrumbs, with a 'head-mirror' meant to prove nothing was lost (MATCH^-N). Ships an engine plus a cinematic page. ROOT0. &middot; homed in the idios realm beside its hub [[delta-protocol]]."),
   ("mirror-solve", "MIRROR-SOLVE · the AI-in-a-box problem", "#5f7fa8", "ai · a proposed containment architecture", "Presents a 'formal solution' to the AI-in-a-box problem — a mirror architecture claimed to eliminate the adversarial-escape preconditions — with canon frozen 2026-04-11, credited to ROOT0 + AVAN (Claude Opus 4.6) under TriPod LLC. Honest read: it advances a strong claim ('eliminates') best weighed as a proposed argument rather than a peer-verified proof. ROOT0. &middot; homed in the ai realm beside its hub [[perceptron-in-silicon]]."),
