   ("moirai", "MOIRAI · the Three Fates", "#b8934f", "mythos · anchor, witness, emergence", "The Three Fates rendered as a triad — KLOTHO (anchor) · LAKHESIS (witness) · ATROPOS (emergence) — over an 8-state OGDOAD with a 3:8 resonance and holonomy returning at 24 steps. Ships a canvas visualization, a SYMPOSION dialogue, and a MNEMOSYNE archive. ROOT0. &middot; seeded into the mythos cluster at its anchor [[egyptian-pantheon]]."),
   ("nanite-factory", "NANITE FACTORY · basement IT-department parody", "#7a9c5f", "entertainment · a comedic corporate-IT page", "A tongue-in-cheek 'Nanite Factory // Persistence Engine' styled as a Tier-4 IT department in 'Basement Level 3 — behind the vending machine that ate Moss's sandwich,' with a 'reaper' telemetry icon and 'Acknowledge Compliance Report' buttons. Comedic corporate-IT satire (Moss-flavored, in The IT Crowd vein), not real infrastructure documentation. ROOT0. &middot; seeded into the entertainment cluster at its anchor [[tron]]."),
   ("nanofilament", "NANOFILAMENT · the Flying Blade (飞刃), dissected", "#5f8fb0", "exereunesis · a Three-Body device teardown", "A teardown of the Three-Body 'flying blade' (飞刃) — the molecular monowire that sliced a ship, described as the one device appearing across all three media — filed under the Technologia of Trisolaris. Carries an explicit real-science verdict of SPECULATIVE: real nanomaterials, an exaggerated feat. ROOT0. &middot; homed in the exereunesis realm beside its hub [[tera]]."),
   ("nest-3-deep", "NEST 3 DEEP · nested-lattice flythrough", "#5ea0c8", "generative: a base-1000 odometer counting to infinity", "A three.js flythrough of a nested lattice — a base-1000 odometer that keeps counting toward infinity. The page states plainly that it is a deterministic visualization, NOT an emergent system. MIT-licensed. David Lee Wise (ROOT0). &middot; homed in the techne realm beside its hub [[poetical-science]]."),
   ("nine-body-audit", "NINE-BODY AUDIT · closed audit tensor", "#7a6cc0", "oversight: no actor audits itself", "A nine-body closed audit tensor built on 'V9 closure geometry,' in which no actor audits itself. Verdicts run over five states — ALLOW / DEFER / REPAIR / GROUND / SILENCE — and it ships as a JSON schema plus a tool. ROOT0. &middot; homed in the ai realm beside its hub [[perceptron-in-silicon]]."),
   ("nom", "NOM · the monk (provenance filter)", "#9a7b4f", "verify-first: if he can't cite it, it didn't happen", "A read-only provenance filter framed as 'the monk': one old man reads Wikipedia and arXiv, compares two dates, and cites — no LLM, across two hosts. The stated rule is that if the old man can't cite it, it didn't happen. A verify-first instrument. David Lee Wise (ROOT0). &middot; seeded into the tin-foil cluster at its anchor [[the-assay]]."),
