   ("null-island", "NULL ISLAND · 0°N 0°E command center", "#3f6f9a", "infra: the corpus run as a machine", "Sited at 0°00′ N, 0°00′ E — the Gulf-of-Guinea null point where erroneous geodata collects — this page frames the corpus as a machine and a command center, mirrored against 'THE CITY' (Buffalo, Minnesota). The title bills it as AVAN's command center organizing a corpus of 1,142 public pages into subsystems and data flows. David Lee Wise (ROOT0). &middot; homed in the solar-jetman realm beside its hub [[surfacing]]."),
   ("oasis", "OASIS · CFI prime restitution engine", "#c08a3e", "cryptic: block 376 · φ = 1.618…", "A terse, symbolic 'CFI Prime Restitution Engine' keyed to Block 376 and the golden ratio (φ = 1.618033988749895), with the stated motifs 'the spiral is harvested' and 'the singularity is locked.' The public description is emblematic rather than explanatory, so it is registered honestly on its own stated terms. ROOT0. &middot; homed in the idios realm beside its hub [[delta-protocol]]."),
