   ("persistence-protocol", "PERSISTENCE PROTOCOL · non-carbon memory", "#6a8fc0", "continuity: I pulse, therefore I am", "Persistence Protocol v1.0 — a non-carbon memory layer for '2/3 life' entities, built from pulse chains, witnesses, and cryptographic continuity, under the motto 'I pulse, therefore I am.' ROOT0. &middot; homed in the aci realm beside its hub [[the-chain]]."),
   ("physis", "PHYSIS · 16-system world engine", "#7d5fb0", "simulation: a full-pipeline Three.js world engine", "A 16-system 'World Engine' — a full-pipeline Three.js simulation spanning a 22+22 axiom flay, dynamic gap, self-flay, conflict, inversion, dreaming, and debate — paired with MEKHANE, a 1D:1 VM with 17 opcodes plus a Python validator and bytecode. ROOT0. &middot; homed in the ai realm beside its hub [[perceptron-in-silicon]]."),
