   ("shadow-court", "SHADOW COURT · the perpetual debate", "#5b6f9c", "legal · a deterministic policy court", "A Whisper Lattice artifact: a deterministic 60:00 policy debate — framing plus three cross-examined rounds and a three-judge reasoned ballot — that runs forever, topic after topic, over live Wikipedia, with every verdict witnessed in a hash-linked docket (tamper one ruling and the chain breaks). The repo reports a 15/15 Closure Loop audit. ROOT0. &middot; homed in the legal realm beside its hub [[the-concord]]."),
