def l2_page_logike(i, key, title, accent, blurb, members):
    """LOGIKĒ · logic — a bespoke keeper page (AVAN + TOP + the keeper). The 58 logicians become
    GATES in a Hasse-style proof lattice: a covering-relation grid rising from ⊥ (axioms, bottom
    left) to ⊤ (theorems, top right), each node a logic gate (∧∨¬→⊢), and a PROOF FRONT sweeps up
    the partial order lighting gates as it reaches them. Hover names, click enters. Indigo blueprint."""
